COVID-19: In order to expand access to concessional loans to business entities, changes were made to the Program "Financing of Business Entities" by the resolution of the Government of the Kyrgyz Republic. The Program additionally includes a number of areas for concessional lending, as a result of which state financial support will be provided to business entities by providing concessional loan funds in the following areas:

- tourism;

- light industry;

- pharmaceutical industry and medicine;

- freight transportation;

- the sphere of education;

- services;

- trade;

- agriculture;

- stimulation of the activity of manufacturing, processing enterprises, including agro-industry.

