Mission: To promote advocacy, research and integration of population issues in development planning in order to contribute towards the establishment of a society that provides a high and equitable quality of life for all Malawians.
Policy Goal: The overall goal of the National Population Policy is to contribute to the improvement of the standard of living and quality of life of the people of Malawi The policy will provide a framework to enhance prioritization, coordination, and implementation of programmes for addressing population and development challenges, with particular focus on rapid population growth, at national and subnational levels.

